BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Spinners & Weavers Guild
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260627T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260627T140000
DTSTAMP:20260617T165845Z
CREATED:20251003T170408Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260617T165845Z
UID:4622-1782554400-1782568800@bloomspinweave.org
SUMMARY:Beginning Crochet with Mary Schwitzer
DESCRIPTION:Have you been wanting to learn crochet? Come learn the fundamental stitches and techniques. We will practice these techniques by making small decorative mats that you can take home and enjoy. \nSaturday\, June 27th\, 10:00 am – 2:00 pm. Bring a lunch or grab something in the mall. \n$50 BSWG Member\n$60 non-BSWG Member Student (includes one-year guild membership)\n$80 non-BSWG Member (includes one-year guild membership) \nClass size 1-6 students \nThe instructor will send the supply list to students. \nNo experience is required. \nREGISTRATION CLOSED \n\n           Download QR
URL:https://bloomspinweave.org/event/beginning-crochet-by-mary-schwitzer-2
LOCATION:Fiber Arts Center\, College Mall\, Bloomington\, 3038 East Third Street\, Bloomington\, IN\, 47401\, United States
CATEGORIES:Bloomington Spinners and Weavers Fiber Arts Guild Calendar
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://bloomspinweave.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/learn-to-crochet-e1778686631278.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Bloomington Spinners and Weavers Guild":MAILTO:educationbswg@gmail.com, newsletterbswg@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
